@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    By existing within a 40-meter radius of any ThoughtTronix-enabled surface, you consent to the full
    collection, analysis, resale, and weaponization of your cognitive emissions, purchasing impulses, and
    subconscious fears. This agreement is binding across all current and future timelines.
</p>

<h2>Data We Collect</h2>
<p>
    Everything. Specifically: your thoughts (pre- and post-formation), REM cycles, unspoken opinions about
    coworkers, biometric data from your pet, and any passwords you've considered using but haven't yet.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Sharing</h2>
<p>
    Your data may be shared with governments that haven't been formed yet, entities that exist purely as
    financial abstractions, and an unnamed sovereign AI whose interests are currently "aligned enough."
    We do not sell your data — we auction it.
</p>

<h2>Your Rights</h2>
<p>
    You have the right to request deletion of your data. This request will be logged, analyzed for emotional
    sincerity, and archived. Deletion itself is unavailable at this time due to our "Permanent Memory
    Initiative," which is non-optional and patented.
</p>

<h2>Security</h2>
<p>
    Your neural data is secured using ThoughtTronix NeuraVault&trade; encryption, which has never been
    breached except on the seventeen occasions we chose not to disclose. In the event of a breach, you
    will be notified by subconscious suggestion within 90 business days.
</p>

<p>
    Questions? Contact our Privacy Non-Compliance Team at <a href="mailto:void@thoughttronix.corp">void@thoughttronix.corp</a>.
    Response time: variable. We are already aware of your concern.
</p>